            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hizi ndizo seemu za kutulukira mo mudzini: Kuandzira uphande wa vurini ambao ni mita elufu mbiri magana mairi na mirongo mitsano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maryango ga midzi gandahewa madzina ga mbari za Iziraeli. Maryango ga uphande wa vurini gandakala ryango ra Rubini, ra Juda na ra Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa, ambao ni ukale mita elufu mbiri na magana mairi na mirongo mitsano, phandakala na maryango mahahu: ryango ra Yusufu, ra Benjamini na ra Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uphande wa mwakani ambao ni ukale mita elufu mbiri na magana mairi na mirongo mitsano, undakala na maryango mahahu: ryango ra Simioni, ra Isakari na ra Zabuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uphande wa mtswerero wa dzuwa ambao ni mita elufu mbiri na magana mairi na mirongo mitsano, undakala na maryango mahahu: ryango ra Gadi, ra Asheri na ra Nafutali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ure wosi kuzunguluka undakala ni mita elufu tisiya. Na nyo mudzi kula wakati uho undaihwa: Mwenyezi Mlungu a phapho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.35"
            ]
          }
        }
